  "transcription": "STAFFING RATE AGREEMENT\nElmbridge Staffing LLC / Customer agreement\nAGREEMENT\nSA-201 | Effective August 1-December 31, 2026\nPARTIES\nElmbridge Staffing LLC and Briarfield Packaging Co.\nASSIGNMENT\nAS-201 | PO BF-201 | Packaging associates\nRATES\nRegular $30.00 per hour; overtime $45.00 per hour.\nAPPROVAL RULE\nCustomer shift supervisors or plant managers may approve overtime in writing. AP approval is\nnot separately required.\nBILLING\nOnly hours supported by the approved weekly time register may be invoiced. Currency USD.\nPayment terms net 30.\nSTF-201 | ES-260901 | Page 1 of 1",
